      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir 1/2 cup condensed soup into beef mixture in the skillet and cook until mixture is hot and bubbling. Heat remaining condensed soup in a 1-quart saucepan over medium-high heat until hot and bubbling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon beef mixture into warm taco shells. Top with condensed soup, lettuce, and tomato.",
